OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman furious about early release
OL,4,Afor driver who killed her husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Slovakian national admitted causing
OL,7,Fdeath by dangerous driving, as well as
OL,8,Fdriving without a licence or insurance,
OL,9,Fand theft. He was jailed for nine years
OL,10,Fin 2023, including time on remand.
OL,12,FKevin's wife, Julie Jarvis, said she
OL,13,Fhad had no warning that Balaz would be
OL,14,Freleased, and errors in the Ministry of
OL,15,FJustice (MoJ) letter when it did arrive
OL,16,Fmeant she felt "invisible, totally
OL,17,Finsignificant". The government has
OL,18,Fsince apologised.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
